{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.72](If young Metro don't trust you— trust you)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:25.76]I can't take one Percocet, start tonight off, I just took a 60\n[00:39.28]Burberry on me, shoot you in your back, you just got Pretty Ricky\n[00:42.30]I tie the Chanel runners, then I get back to running the city\n[00:46.30]And I know that it's hell coming, I ain't worried, my niggas, they with me\n[00:51.40]Gotta put the narcotics down, I can feel 'em fucking up my kidney\n[00:55.28]And punching my liver\n[00:56.32]If I let it kill me, my mama'll never forgive me\n[00:59.38]Ain't numbing my feelings, if I let it kill 'em, my baby will never forgive me\n[01:03.44]This remind me of hell, sometimes I wonder if that's where God really sent me\n[Chorus]\n[01:07.92]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[01:12.16]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[01:16.14]I pray to God for some water to wash down these Percs\n[01:20.36]I been cursed since birth, guess I never learn\n[01:24.60]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[01:28.86]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[01:32.84]I pray to God for some water to wash down these Percs\n[01:37.06]I been cursed since birth, guess I never learn\n[Verse 2]\n[01:41.12]The truth hurts, let it bleed out, if they hurt you, let 'em leave\n[01:45.30]My heart hurtin', let me bleed out, only way I'll find peace\n[01:49.50]I'm tryna get set free, but these chains on me\n[01:53.46]Choke me, I can't breathe, what's reality?\n[01:57.54]Uh, detached from myself\n[01:59.70]Uh-huh, numb the pain with my wealth\n[02:01.72]Uh, a bag from Chanel match the double C on my belt, uh\n[02:06.38]Bands in my pants, I barely be holdin' my pants up\n[02:10.30]But the money ain't the answer\n[02:12.84]I'm just tryna reach some new highs\n[02:16.02]Mix this with that, bet it feel nice\n[02:18.10]Codeine, only sip if I got ice\n[02:19.94]Look my girl in her eyes, tell her I won't die\n[02:22.14]I fell asleep too deep that one time\n[02:24.14]Woke up to your cry, girl, I'm fine\n[02:26.30]But I lied\n[02:27.48]Had a dream, I wasn't gon' wake up this time\n[Chorus]\n[02:31.58]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[02:35.64]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[02:39.70]I pray to God for some water to wash down these Percs\n[02:46.28]I been cursed since birth, guess I never learn\n[03:04.48]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[03:30.26]Hands up in the fire, burn, burn, burn, burn\n[03:32.64]I pray to God for some water to wash down these Percs\n[03:34.90]I been cursed since birth, guess I never learn","words":[[0.72,0.84,"(If"],[1.0,1.7,"young"],[4.5,4.9,"Metro"],[9.72,10.04,"don't"],[10.94,11.46,"trust"],[13.16,13.42,"you—"],[14.6,15.1,"trust"],[15.26,15.5,"you)"],[25.76,25.76,"I"],[26.2,26.92,"can't"],[32.48,35.32,"take"],[35.66,35.74,"one"],[35.78,36.22,"Percocet,"],[36.26,36.4,"start"],[36.44,36.78,"tonight"],[36.84,36.92,"off,"],[37.04,37.04,"I"],[37.1,37.26,"just"],[37.32,37.44,"took"],[37.5,37.5,"a"],[37.52,38.9,"60"],[39.28,39.76,"Burberry"],[39.86,39.88,"on"],[39.94,39.98,"me,"],[40.08,40.22,"shoot"],[40.32,40.46,"you"],[40.5,40.54,"in"],[40.6,40.74,"your"],[40.82,40.98,"back,"],[41.02,41.12,"you"],[41.16,41.3,"just"],[41.34,41.46,"got"],[41.52,41.78,"Pretty"],[41.92,42.24,"Ricky"],[42.3,42.3,"I"],[43.32,43.36,"tie"],[43.42,43.52,"the"],[43.76,44.2,"Chanel"],[44.32,44.62,"runners,"],[44.66,44.78,"then"],[44.92,44.92,"I"],[45.0,45.08,"get"],[45.14,45.26,"back"],[45.32,45.38,"to"],[45.48,45.8,"running"],[45.84,45.88,"the"],[46.02,46.26,"city"],[46.3,46.4,"And"],[46.5,46.5,"I"],[47.6,47.74,"know"],[47.78,47.94,"that"],[48.0,48.12,"it's"],[48.16,48.4,"hell"],[48.48,48.86,"coming,"],[48.9,48.9,"I"],[49.0,49.14,"ain't"],[49.18,49.44,"worried,"],[49.5,49.62,"my"],[49.7,49.96,"niggas,"],[50.02,50.16,"they"],[50.26,50.42,"with"],[50.52,50.64,"me"],[51.4,51.64,"Gotta"],[51.74,51.86,"put"],[51.92,51.96,"the"],[52.06,52.56,"narcotics"],[52.64,52.9,"down,"],[52.98,52.98,"I"],[5